                                                "sense_id": "45222ae3-a670-3f05-843e-5aabf1c8bccf",
                                                "text": "THE CONCISE ENCYCLOPAEDIA OF WORLD RAILWAY LOCOMOTIVES. Edited by P. Ransome-Wallis. Hutchinson. 50s. [...] The work is a symposium by writers who are mostly specialists in the topics about which they write."
